        "ggs95X7bDCr_text": "<p>4.8/5 Excellent | Based on 1,242 Reviews</p>",
        "ggKVdqH2bwk_text": "flood your body with the \"missing fuel\" that powers your energy, drive, and testosterone",
        "ggugerOEuRy_text": "<p><strong>137,235+ Men Have Ended \"Cellular Starvation\" and Restored Their Edge with Pure Himalayan Shilajit.</strong></p><p><br>Wellness Nest™ Shilajit Essential Extract is designed to reclaim what makes you feel like a man - strength, stamina, and the unshakable confidence that shows in how you move, work, and perform.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just one daily dose helps you reclaim stamina, confidence, and drive - without caffeine, stimulants, or shortcuts.</p>",
        "ggOiVXP6n1I_text": "<p><strong>End the \"Afternoon Crash\": </strong>Restore consistent ATP energy production without jitters.</p>",
        "ggL7gWlJAzu_text": "<p><strong>Reignite Natural Drive:</strong> Supply the Zinc &amp; Magnesium your body needs to regulate healthy T-Levels naturally.</p>",
        "ggNfhucataV_text": "<p><strong>Stop \"Hiding\": </strong>Clear brain fog and regain the mental stamina to be present in your life.</p>",
        "ggFMfmdeSO4_text": "<p><strong>Lab-Tested Purity: </strong>Gold Grade resin. No fillers. No heavy metals. Just earth.</p>",
        "ggPZZbh4QpP_text": "<p>274 clinicians share this on <i>FrontrowMD&nbsp;</i></p><p>without compensation.</p>",
        "gg1quX85hBu_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">Delivered on</span></p>",
        "gg-uuTDAxOh_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">with Express Shipping</span></p>",
        "ggaSsjraS_J_label": "ADD TO CART",
        "ggaSsjraS_J_outOfStockLabel": "Out of stock",
        "ggaSsjraS_J_unavailableLabel": "Unavailable",
        "ggaSsjraS_J_variantSelectionRequiredMessage": "Please select a variant to add product to cart",
        "gggMdHxYLYP_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Order Above $70</p>",
        "ggztyokQsHX_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>",
        "ggYXegu9WzN_childItem_0": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "gg-QA2LrZUQ_childItem_0": "<p>Over 100,000 Happy Customers</p>",
        "gg1MjGkwjPD_text": "<p><strong>Zach M. | FL</strong></p>",
        "ggxXkmQUnTp_text": "<p>“Not claiming inches, but the look is unmistakable — fuller, heavier, and it stays that way. That visual boost killed a lot of second-guessing in the moment.”</p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"color:#121212;\">How Does It Work?</span></p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"color:#121212;\">What Can Our Shilajit Help With?</span></p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_2": "<p>When Will I See Results?</p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_3": "<p>How Long Until I Get It?</p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_4": "<p>Who Can Use It?</p>",
        "gg0DcKkf3C-_childItem_5": "<p>90-day Money-back Guarantee?</p>",
        "ggt9pJAj7UC_text": "<p><strong>The Science Behind Wellness Nest™ Shilajit Essential Extract</strong></p><p><br>Most supplements add MORE to your already-overloaded system.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit is different. It delivers what's MISSING.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your mitochondria (the energy factories in every cell) need specific trace minerals to produce ATP-your body's energy currency.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Modern food doesn't provide them anymore. Soil depletion means even \"healthy\" diets leave you running on 15 minerals when you need 85+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit floods your cells with:</p><p><br>✅ 85+ ionic trace minerals (in bioavailable form)</p><p><br>✅ Fulvic Acid (the \"delivery truck\" that carries nutrients<br>directly into cells)</p><p><br>✅ Dibenzo-α-pyrones (compounds that supercharge mitochondria)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result? Your cells finally have fuel. Energy production normalizes. Hormone regulation improves. The \"fog\" lifts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most men notice the shift within 10-14 days.</p>",
        "ggmrPdn0GhK_text": "<p><strong>⚡ Low Energy &amp; Afternoon Crashes</strong></p><p>Clean, steady energy-without caffeine jitters or evening crashes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🔥 Low Drive &amp; Confidence</strong></p><p>Support healthy testosterone and performance-so your presence and power return.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🏋️ Slow Recovery &amp; Soreness</strong></p><p>Mineral support for training resilience, recovery, and fewer “tired” days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🧠 Brain Fog &amp; Poor Focus</strong></p><p>Feel sharper and more decisive when it counts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>😌 Stress &amp; Irritability</strong></p><p>Nutrient support for calm, composed control under pressure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🛌 Sleep Quality</strong></p><p>Better wind-down and deeper overnight recovery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🛡️ Immunity &amp; Antioxidant Support</strong></p><p>Backed by 85+ trace minerals and natural antioxidants.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>💥 Bedroom Stamina &amp; Performance</strong><br>Stay ready longer, recover faster, and perform with confidence every time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🍆 Morning Vitality &amp; Sexual Confidence</strong><br>Consistent morning erections are your body’s sign of restored hormonal balance - and she’ll notice the difference before you do.</p>",
        "ggE9i8jnpKs_text": "<p><strong>📅 Days 3–7</strong></p><p>The afternoon slump doesn't hit as hard. Sleep feels deeper. You wake up without that groggy drag.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>📆 Weeks 2–3</strong></p><p>Focus sharpens. Workouts feel different—more drive, better recovery. Mood steadies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>📈 Weeks 4–6</strong></p><p>Energy feels \"locked in.\" Stamina lasts longer. Evenings aren't wasted. Your partner might comment that you seem... different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🏁 Month 2 and beyond</strong></p><p>The compound effect kicks in. You're not just managing. You're performing. The version of yourself you remember starts coming back. This isn't magic. It's what happens when you give your body what it's been missing for years.</p>",
        "ggiVEOC1a-e_text": "<p>All orders are assembled and shipped from the USA (with globally and domestically sourced ingredients). We process orders within 1–2 business days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most customers in the U.S. receive their package within 3–5 business days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You’ll receive a tracking number as soon as your order ships.</p>",
        "ggq0jaXntGH_text": "<p>Wellness Nest™ Shilajit Essential Extract is for men who want natural, sustainable performance, without stimulants or steroids.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Especially helpful for:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>• Men 35+ who feel their edge slipping.<br>• Busy professionals with afternoon crashes.<br>• Lifters and athletes wanting faster recovery.<br>• Men who want drive, confidence, and presence back—naturally.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Gentle on the stomach. No caffeine. No stimulants. No synthetic additives.</p>",
        "ggj9QvcHVhZ_text": "<p>We stand behind our formulas — but we also understand results can vary.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That’s why your first order is protected by our<strong> 90-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>, so you can try Wellness Nest completely risk-free.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>How it works:</p><p>✅ Applies to your first purchase of any product or bundle</p><p>✅ Covers one-time orders and first subscription shipments</p><p>✅ Valid for up to 3 units per product</p><p>✅ Request within 90 days of delivery</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you’re not satisfied, simply contact our Customer Experience Team with your order number.</p>"
      }
    },
